"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal for October to November in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, January to February ran 16% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, the middle of the grids shows February to March at 48% and June to July at 66% of normal. Grid 27439 had its driest year in 1958 at 45% of normal.</p>"}
